rsx_vertex_compact: fetch a draw's vertices attribute by attribute (open upstream PR, imported as is).

The draw engine fetched every unique vertex through rsx_vertex_fetch_one, re-deriving each attribute's type and index per vertex; rsx_vertex_fetch_one / rsx_vertex_decode_element are hot on Resistance 3's present thread (the FIFO walker).

Measured in Resistance 3 as one batch (#437 #438 #440 #458 #459 #465 #466), Home level, stick turning, two runs each:
22.7 -> 24.2 fps; present thread busy 640 -> 556 of 657 `sample` ticks. Frames of a scripted run unchanged.

Upstream: PR #458 (drop this file when the pin contains it).

---

